3. Distribution boundary

The following must not be committed or distributed until their redistribution
rights are confirmed and documented:

- official school DOCX/PDF files and seals;
- real student data, signatures, supervisor comments, or private samples;
- credentials, signing certificates, notarization materials, and tokens.

Font files are a separate decision. The project maintainer decided on
2026-11-26 that the commercial fonts used by the document templates
(STZhongsong, STXingkai, FZXiaoBiaoSong and the bundled East Asian fallbacks)
are shipped with the offline installer for a non-commercial, free-of-charge
product, and accepted responsibility for that redistribution. This notice
records the maintainer's decision; it is not a statement that a font license
review has been completed.

For release packaging only, the project maintainer confirmed redistribution
authorization on 2026-09-04 for these three process-document template copies:

- templates/proposal/word/official-template.docx;
- templates/task-book/word/official-template.docx;
- templates/midterm/word/official-template.docx.

They are copied from the trusted adjacent template checkout into a temporary
build staging directory. The staging step removes personal core, extended, and
custom document properties before calculating release hashes and template
identity. This exception does not authorize redistribution of any other school
document, seal, commercial font, student material, or private reference.

